  !>                         4 5 6 9
  !>                         7 8 9 0
  !>               - if uplo == HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_LOWER:
  !>                 The lower triangular portion of each symmetric matrix A_i is supplied.
  !>                 The matrix is compacted so that AP contains the triangular portion
  !>                 column-by-column
